<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 02:11:41 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>人工智能落后步伐的争论以及商业距离前沿有多远</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/ai-pacing-debate-how-fast-slow-wrong-debate-frontier/</link><description>在每一次技术革命中，最大的财富都属于那些明白在定居者到达之前边境毫无价值的人。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2235057491-e1790099160420.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 17:49:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/ai-pacing-debate-how-fast-slow-wrong-debate-frontier/</guid></item><item><title>Meta 的 Muse AI 正在迅速流行，并且已经引起了另一家科技巨头的强烈反对</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/metas-muse-ai-is-exploding-in-popularity-and-drawing-heated-backlash/</link><description>该应用程序使用 Meta 最新的 Muse Spark AI 模型，将用户连接到其 AI 代理自主处理的一系列服务。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2296543533-e1790113153124.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 22:11:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/metas-muse-ai-is-exploding-in-popularity-and-drawing-heated-backlash/</guid></item><item><title>独家：毕马威重组人工智能部门以创建新的孵化器——新的高管职位直接向首席执行官汇报</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/kpmg-ai-reorg-todd-lohr-steve-case-retirement/</link><description>“人工智能非常棒，”直接向首席执行官蒂姆·沃尔什汇报的人工智能主管托德·洛尔 (Todd Lohr) 说，“但这也是每个人都需要承担的重大责任。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2295252304-1-e1790027564712.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/kpmg-ai-reorg-todd-lohr-steve-case-retirement/</guid